{"id":"ddtw","title":"DTW on first differences","family":"elastic","definition":"reference","intro_en":"This atlas entry applies DTW to first differences, so the alignment responds to changes rather than absolute levels. The first frames expose the transformed series before the local table is accumulated. It is an explicit first-difference variant; other DDTW implementations use a smoothed derivative estimator.","intro_zh":"本条目对一阶差分使用 DTW，因此匹配依据是变化而非绝对水平。动图先展示变换后的序列，再构造累计表。本例明确使用一阶差分；其他 DDTW 实现可能采用平滑导数估计。","steps_en":["Take first differences with the stated convention.","Compute local squared discrepancies; apply the indicated weights or admissibility mask.","At each admissible cell, add its local cost to the smallest predecessor cost.","Trace one minimizing path and take the square root of its accumulated objective."],"steps_zh":["按明确约定计算一阶差分。","计算局部平方误差，并施加指定权重或允许匹配的掩码。","在每个允许单元格，把局部代价加到三个前驱的最小累计代价上。","回溯一条最小化目标的路径，并对其累计目标值取平方根。"],"formula":"Delta x_i=x_(i+1)-x_i; d=DTW(Delta x,Delta y), squared costs then square root","caveats_en":["Differencing removes constant offsets and amplifies high-frequency noise. The result depends on the derivative estimator.","Signal scale, path constraints and final normalization must match before distances from different tools are compared."],"caveats_zh":["差分消除常数偏移，也会放大高频噪声；结果取决于导数估计方法。","比较不同工具的数值之前，须统一信号尺度、路径约束和最终归一化。"],"sources":[{"label":"tslearn: DTW definitions and path constraints","url":"https://tslearn.readthedocs.io/en/stable/user_guide/dtw.html"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"local_cost":"squared Euclidean","final_square_root":true,"normalization":"none","derivative":"adjacent first differences; n-1 